== leave ==
I turned and began to walk away, this man was clearly outside of his mind.
However, as I did so, Monsier Fogg called out and spoke words that caught my attention and stopped me in my tracks.
->ending
=== ending
"We shall circumnavigate the globe within eighty days." He was quite calm as he proposed this wild scheme. "We leave for Paris on the 8:25. In an hour."
{not nod: This was going to be a wild ride.}
